        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "There are ordinary civilians, criminals, and refugees - all mixed together."
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We'll have to make thorough preparations.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We'll have to make thorough preparations."
